@netforge/template-collector (MOSSBOUND)
Copyright (c) 2026 NetNet Capital Management

An original game. No names, characters, maps, models, sounds or code from
any other game or franchise.

Art and sound
- Models come from the per-style asset library
  (@netforge/asset-library): CC0 1.0 models by Kenney and
  Quaternius (animals, monsters, Nature Kit), each pack listed with its
  source URL and licence verification in that package's NOTICE and
  manifest/packs.json. The files are fetched and built, never committed
  here; the build copies only the models this game uses.
- Fallback shapes (@netforge/tabletop stage.ts) are generated from three.js
  primitives; all textures are drawn on a canvas at load; sounds are the
  library's CC0 samples with WebAudio synth fallbacks.

Dependencies (unmodified, via npm)
- three.js 0.186.1 (https://github.com/mrdoob/three.js), MIT.
- @netforge/engine and @netforge/engine-sim (this repository);
  see their NOTICE files (bitECS MPL-2.0, Rapier Apache-2.0, Colyseus MIT,
  zod MIT).

Patterns (ideas only)
- The creature-collecting RPG genre's general mechanics (meeting creatures
  in tall grass, turn-based battles, a small team, catching, levels).
  Mechanics, not expression: the creatures, names, elements, items, map
  and text are original, and no creature, design, type chart or item was
  copied from any game.
